OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein to protest Trump's visit
OL,4,Ato Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein representatives will be a
OL,7,Fpart of the protests against US
OL,8,FPresident Donald Trump's visit to
OL,9,FIreland this weekend.
OL,11,FTrump will meet the Irish president
OL,12,FCatherine Connolly and Taoiseach (Irish
OL,13,Fprime minister) Micheal Martin before
OL,14,Fflying to his golf course at Doonbeg in
OL,15,FCounty Clare, where he will watch the
OL,16,FAmgen Irish Open golf tournament.
OL,18,FSignificant numbers of people are
OL,19,Fexpected to protest against his visit,
OL,20,Fwith opposition politicians saying the
OL,21,FIrish government should not be rolling
OL,22,Fout the "red carpet".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
