OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein to protest Trump's visit
OL,4,Ato Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein party leader Mary Lou
OL,7,FMcDonald said "correctly" there will be
OL,8,Fprotests and said her party will form
OL,9,Fpart of those demonstrations.
